Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:09.04,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 14 \N {\fs100} Wedding Anniversary {結婚記念日の巻}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.21,0:00:20.55,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Spring has come to the Hermit Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.57,0:00:25.72,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Here, at the Senior Apprentice's house... {兄弟子}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Time sure flies...{????}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our 138th wedding anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But I really can't help feeling like a grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.22,0:01:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't fight your age that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.49,0:01:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much make-up I apply, \Nthe years show through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.91,0:01:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I still remember how happy I was back then. {????}{literally a second away she is remembering her past, what's the question?}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.29,0:01:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My body was so slim, from head to toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It was something like this. {?????}{こんなだったかしら}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.78,0:01:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My groom looked \Nmighty smartish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.84,0:01:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We know he's become \Ncompletely shameless by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.40,0:01:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But back then, when our eyes so much as met, \Nhe would at once get flustered,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.84,0:01:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and would be too shy \Nto even look at me again. {????????????????????? no clue what's that comparison to a cracked bell is about}{isn't a cracked bell's sound dull? Then the comparison would be that their hearts would sound dull due to the irregular beating or something idk}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,While hoping for something, \Nwe both couldn't bring ourselves to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew, it's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.11,0:01:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were the happiest days of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, \NI wonder where he went now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:03.46,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This is the main street of the Hermit Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:13.08,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh? It seems Senior Disciple is choosing an anniversary present for his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.83,0:02:17.88,Narrator,,0,0,0,,He's a little different from his usual self.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, come on in! Look at my goods!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.30,0:02:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All the lovely fishes here! {????????????}{可愛いの居ですよ}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Got them in all sizes and colors!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.86,0:02:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.96,0:02:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.53,0:02:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister, looking for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, tropical fishes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.99,0:02:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind you, I caught them all \Ndown in the southern seas myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If this one was a woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:49.33,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Come on, now! \NYou know thinking about that is wrong. {maybe this is narrator?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.54,0:02:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just imagining it is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Mister, which will it be? {?????????}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll have these.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Great choice, sir! \NThanks for your purchase!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My, that's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tropical fish are very time-consuming, \Nso you must really love them to keep them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.76,0:03:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They say people who love animals are always kind at heart, and I'm sure you're like that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not today! It's a special day for me and my wife that only comes once a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.23,0:03:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I should hurry home now \Nand surprise my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No... You also only meet \Na woman like that once a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.36,0:03:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I see my wife every day already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.35,0:04:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, let's hurry home, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.07,0:04:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.18,0:04:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What a Guppy-like person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let myself slip up here. {??????}{can't let it get to me}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.24,0:04:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.71,0:04:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My! Is this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.15,0:04:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How delightful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.23,0:04:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew you had this kind side in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,His wife reciprocated it \Nwith a splendid feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.09,0:04:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, eat until you're full.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.83,0:05:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Finished already? \NGive me a minute, I'll clean everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get you into a bath next.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:13.94,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Goodness, his wife is also quite gentle today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.24,0:05:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How embarrassing! \NYou know everyone is watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.27,0:05:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.36,0:05:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That hit the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.01,0:05:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A wedding anniversary can be good too, at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let me give you a massage next.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... It hurts! Can't you be softer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.19,0:05:56.76,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Enough complaining. Are you a man or not? {???????}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No falling asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too happy now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.77,0:06:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The stars are glittering now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that our happy wedding anniversary is coming to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So the wedding anniversary has ended?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.83,0:06:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This means I can also finally be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.55,0:06:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that woman I met earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.97,0:06:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman was piping hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.61,0:06:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.52,0:06:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.83,0:06:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My! And what's this supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Husband...! Yesterday, you did a bit more in town than just buying presents, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:07:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not. \NI bought you an anniversary gift, that's all...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how do you explain \Nthat lipstick mark on your neck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.45,0:07:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.83,0:07:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm mistaken feel free to prove it! {???????}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just where were you at?! {?????????}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.79,0:07:10.99,Overlap,,0,0,0,,N-No, that's just... Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.99,0:07:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What, "Mom"?! {think she means "What are you calling your mom for?" but that's 25 cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.10,0:07:16.75,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh? Do men really need \Nto cheat even in their dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you try to hide from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.26,0:07:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.60,0:07:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I've got an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.74,0:07:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I heard him from this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? They're adorable fellows \Nwhenever I see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.89,0:07:49.41,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't believe this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,can become women. \NMay they all become women! {is this unironically referencing what cham mentioned}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nice view!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, ladies! Come here, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a neon tetra, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm a guppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a kissing gourami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an angel fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.05,0:08:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:09:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there you are. \NGet out of there now or I'll catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.74,0:09:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I'd let myself be caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.89,0:09:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, where is \Nthat beauty I saw yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:16.69,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The moment his wedding anniversary is over, \Nthe Senior Disciple is back to his usual ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there it is! \NIt has to be hers for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.02,0:09:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, dinner time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can watch her all day long from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.24,0:09:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? I wonder when that weird fish got in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a deformed{出来損ない} pufferfish. {????}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.68,0:09:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I might as well sell it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:58.24,Narrator,,0,0,0,,What a pity for Senior Disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.24,0:09:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you buy this fish from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.98,0:10:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. Lemme see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.73,0:10:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... That's an unusual fish indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Name your price, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And she left!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.87,0:10:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come! \NHey, lady! You, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, won't you take a glance at my wares?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.11,0:10:19.10,Overlap,,0,0,0,,What nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.24,0:10:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying you should buy it. {????????}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at them, that's all I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got all kinds of fish you can think of!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.67,0:10:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you look at this one, you'll see \Nthat it's even wearing glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.91,0:10:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I like this one. \NI'm buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.69,0:10:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you sure have a good eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.97,0:10:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Always a pleasure dealing \Nwith a discerning buyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your purchase!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:49.24,Narrator,,0,0,0,,With this, the fish incident \Nseems to have been concluded. {????????????????}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:54.24,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But married life sure is tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Husband! \NI did enjoy chasing you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a certain suspense to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But I never thought \NI'd find you in a place like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I also feel more comfortable doing this than being treated nicely like on our wedding anniversary. {????}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I've been living \Non this thrill for 138 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.14,0:11:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm probably addicted now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.24,0:11:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're not getting away this time. {?????}{もう何処へも行らないから}
